# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### GET /example
-  added the optional property `first/shared/extra` to the response with the `200` status (shared schema: `Shared`, also at `third/shared/extra`, `fourth/shared/extra` and 1 more)
-  the `first/shared/id` response's property pattern `^[0-9]+$` was added for the status `200` (shared schema: `Shared`, also at `third/shared/id`, `fourth/shared/id` and 1 more)






